WEBVTT

00:00.792 --> 00:04.421
I have to save Shigaraki and the others...

00:05.714 --> 00:10.427
Himiko Toga, what do you want to do?

00:11.470 --> 00:15.974
I want to annihilate all the
heroes, starting with Hawks.

00:16.225 --> 00:19.811
GUNGA VILLA SITE

00:20.312 --> 00:21.605
It's Toga!

00:22.272 --> 00:25.067
She had some of Bubaigawara's blood?

00:26.860 --> 00:29.112
Was Dabi behind this?!

00:30.072 --> 00:31.782
It's too late!

00:33.325 --> 00:38.330
Whether you cry or laugh, tomorrow
will come with impartiality.

00:38.413 --> 00:42.542
If that's the case, then
let's laugh, Himiko Toga.

00:43.544 --> 00:47.047
Let's continue his march of grief.

00:48.548 --> 00:50.050
Infinite Doubles...

00:50.133 --> 00:53.011
Sad Man's Death Parade!

00:53.720 --> 00:56.265
Then, we'll be the ones...

00:57.599 --> 00:59.226
...with the last laugh.

01:05.148 --> 01:09.903
They're... giving us no
room to move, 'shroom...

01:11.363 --> 01:14.950
I won't lose sight of you again!

01:20.163 --> 01:22.416
The feelings that you kept locked up...

01:25.377 --> 01:27.796
Ochaco, you...

01:29.464 --> 01:32.759
I still haven't gotten to
talk about romance with you!

01:35.762 --> 01:37.222
Stop pestering me...

01:38.557 --> 01:41.685
There's no maiden in love here anymore...

01:42.269 --> 01:43.603
Hero!

01:46.356 --> 01:51.236
Can a butterfly that flaps its wings
in Brazil cause a hurricane in Texas?

01:51.695 --> 01:57.576
Will superhuman society, which began with
a glowing baby, be overwhelmed by chaos?

01:58.827 --> 02:01.621
The world can change with
the power of one person.

03:46.309 --> 03:47.769
Get behind the earthen wall!

03:47.853 --> 03:49.479
Everyone, get back for now!

03:49.855 --> 03:53.066
I can't spread my spores because
of the flames, 'shroom!

03:53.400 --> 03:55.652
Move the captured villains, too!

03:55.735 --> 03:57.529
Or else they'll burn to death!

03:59.614 --> 04:02.534
It's not just Himiko Toga and Kurogiri.

04:02.951 --> 04:04.703
Dabi's here, too...

04:06.413 --> 04:10.709
Todoroki... Shoji... Everyone...

04:10.792 --> 04:11.877
Uravity!

04:12.294 --> 04:13.753
Froppy!

04:14.713 --> 04:15.797
Tsukuyomi!

04:15.881 --> 04:17.466
Earphone Jack!

04:19.176 --> 04:23.054
This battle can only lead to chaos.

04:23.722 --> 04:26.141
Kyoka, your ear...!

04:27.225 --> 04:32.022
If this is all I got after fighting the
demon lord, I think I was pretty lucky.

04:33.648 --> 04:36.860
If you all came out of the same gate,

04:36.943 --> 04:39.529
that means the Twice army is Toga, right?

04:40.322 --> 04:43.158
At this rate, Japan will be buried.

04:44.326 --> 04:45.619
We have to stop them.

04:46.286 --> 04:49.372
But Dabi's flames are too hot.

04:50.457 --> 04:52.918
Toga can just ignore them
and keep making more,

04:53.335 --> 04:56.630
but all we can do is try to get away.

04:58.256 --> 04:59.925
This isn't a battle anymore!

05:02.135 --> 05:03.929
They've broken through our
strategy to split everyone up.

05:08.850 --> 05:11.102
The flames on his chest...

05:11.186 --> 05:13.522
Is that the Phosphor Shoto
was talking about?

05:14.231 --> 05:17.692
What happened to Shoto, Toya?!

05:18.276 --> 05:20.779
I wanted to bring him as a gift for you,

05:21.279 --> 05:23.323
but he was too strong...

05:23.782 --> 05:27.953
I won't be able to make my whole
dream come true anymore...

05:28.787 --> 05:33.708
But I'll take as many of the
things important to you...

05:33.792 --> 05:36.086
the things you're trying to protect...

05:36.169 --> 05:38.672
as I can...

05:43.468 --> 05:45.679
The winds are in my favor.

05:46.763 --> 05:51.852
Everything's linking together
and falling in place for me.

05:52.519 --> 05:56.439
Kurogiri himself probably went to Tomura.

05:57.774 --> 06:02.487
That Warp has a longer effective range
than my incomplete Sludge Warp,

06:02.571 --> 06:06.199
so it would've been best if
I got that one for myself,

06:06.866 --> 06:08.076
but it's fine.

06:08.451 --> 06:10.745
I'll ride this chaos

06:11.204 --> 06:13.331
and go to Tomura!

06:22.674 --> 06:24.884
Hawks...

06:25.385 --> 06:29.139
You should face Bubaigawara's dying wish.

06:29.764 --> 06:34.644
Even with Rewind on you, you
seem to be in a hurry.

06:35.270 --> 06:38.231
Do you not trust Shigaraki?

06:40.900 --> 06:42.694
You're quick to understand.

06:43.278 --> 06:44.487
That's right.

06:45.238 --> 06:48.867
He's still not complete
in the truest sense.

06:50.035 --> 06:53.455
There's a reason he still
needs me like this.

06:54.914 --> 06:56.666
Endeavor!

06:56.750 --> 07:00.378
The plan to split everyone up
stopped working a long time ago!

07:00.670 --> 07:03.381
At this rate, it'll be too
hot for anyone to fight.

07:03.465 --> 07:07.427
If we're wiped out here, everything will
be headed toward Deku and Shigaraki!

07:07.886 --> 07:09.888
Please stop Toya!

07:12.641 --> 07:14.351
How mean.

07:14.434 --> 07:18.063
To say that to someone who's lost
an arm and is about to pass out.

07:18.146 --> 07:21.024
Besides, aren't you the one who said it?

07:21.441 --> 07:26.446
That his mission was to defeat
me as quickly as possible?

07:26.529 --> 07:27.947
He should abandon his duty--?

07:28.031 --> 07:29.866
Shut up!

07:30.784 --> 07:32.827
You've already...

07:32.911 --> 07:36.623
lost to our number one hero once.

07:36.915 --> 07:39.125
So he's not abandoning anything!

07:40.543 --> 07:42.337
Now you're just quibbling.

07:49.678 --> 07:51.221
My duty...

07:57.769 --> 07:59.062
This time...

07:59.896 --> 08:00.980
I will...

08:01.981 --> 08:02.941
...watch.

08:03.775 --> 08:07.779
THE CHAIN THUS FAR

08:08.029 --> 08:10.949
COFFIN IN THE SKY

08:16.121 --> 08:17.038
Yamada.

08:18.206 --> 08:19.165
Then...

08:57.954 --> 08:59.706
BELOW U.A. CAMPUS
- They got one of the power poles!

08:59.789 --> 09:01.332
BELOW U.A. CAMPUS
- We can't put in a spare!

09:01.416 --> 09:02.542
BELOW U.A. CAMPUS
- It's going to fall apart!

09:02.625 --> 09:05.253
It's the price we're paying
for rushing this job!

09:06.129 --> 09:07.422
What about the electromagnetic barrier?

09:07.505 --> 09:10.050
There's not enough output with what's left!

09:10.842 --> 09:12.218
This is Mandalay.

09:12.302 --> 09:14.554
The levitation control's stopped working!

09:15.930 --> 09:17.015
We've been hacked!

09:17.557 --> 09:19.642
Someone's taken over the controls!

09:20.727 --> 09:23.438
I'm finally in.

09:24.731 --> 09:27.525
Fall, heroes.

09:28.610 --> 09:29.778
At the same time,

09:30.111 --> 09:32.363
the control center island
is currently under attack!

09:32.697 --> 09:35.658
Phantom Thief is unable
to continue his mission!

09:37.035 --> 09:38.953
Erasure has been neutralized!

09:39.078 --> 09:42.957
At the rate, the worst villain
ever will be let loose!

09:45.543 --> 09:46.920
Kurogiri...!

09:47.420 --> 09:49.756
Does that mean Central's--

09:50.381 --> 09:51.633
If U.A. falls,

09:52.092 --> 09:55.386
Japan--no, the world--

09:56.012 --> 09:58.807
will be destroyed by his hands.

10:01.434 --> 10:02.894
It's peeling off?

10:03.228 --> 10:04.229
Is he molting?

10:04.687 --> 10:05.939
He's not moving...

10:08.274 --> 10:11.736
Even if... I'm here...

10:12.612 --> 10:14.906
What did you want to do?

10:17.450 --> 10:22.288
Is Shigaraki... still in there?

10:23.289 --> 10:26.251
You wanna have a little chat
at the shopping mall?

10:27.377 --> 10:29.629
It's pointless, hero.

10:29.712 --> 10:33.258
I'm your villain!

10:36.094 --> 10:39.722
Shigaraki's persona!

10:44.477 --> 10:48.314
This is what happens if U.A.'s
system if I touch it.

10:48.731 --> 10:51.943
The underground evacuation system
is also already in my hands!

10:52.068 --> 10:55.572
Foolish masses and heroes still
clinging to the old state of affairs

10:55.655 --> 11:00.410
should all fall in the name of liberation!

11:05.206 --> 11:07.625
I have to stop U.A. from falling!

11:07.959 --> 11:12.046
If it falls like this, then Yaoyorozu and
the others at the bottom will be goners.

11:12.463 --> 11:15.174
At the same time, to make sure
Shigaraki doesn't get away,

11:15.258 --> 11:17.176
I need to keep watching Kurogiri and--

11:18.386 --> 11:22.932
No, damn it! I can't
breathe. I'm suffocating--

11:23.725 --> 11:26.895
It's the backlash from the
powered-up Gearshift...

11:27.478 --> 11:32.275
If I don't let my cells rest, I
can't take in enough oxygen.

11:32.859 --> 11:35.778
I told you, you can't be defeated yet.

11:37.572 --> 11:41.367
But maybe this is a blessing in disguise.

11:42.076 --> 11:45.371
It looks like they're having a hard
time integrating on their side, too.

11:46.164 --> 11:50.418
One For All and All For One are
resonating with each other,

11:50.501 --> 11:52.587
so we can look "inside" the other.

11:53.963 --> 11:57.467
It doesn't look like he can move
that body freely at the moment.

11:58.092 --> 12:02.597
Right now, you should try and get your
body to move as soon as possible.

12:03.556 --> 12:06.100
Everything that has happened up until now

12:06.726 --> 12:09.020
will definitely help you.

12:10.313 --> 12:11.648
Found you!

12:12.607 --> 12:14.734
You finally showed yourself, huh?

12:14.817 --> 12:17.070
You were pretty hard to find!

12:18.112 --> 12:19.072
Huh?

12:19.322 --> 12:21.991
But it wasn't a bit of trouble for me!

12:22.492 --> 12:25.954
FORMER CRIME CLIP UPLOADER VILLAIN
LA BRAVA
- Because it was all for Gentle's sake!

12:27.580 --> 12:29.958
IZUKU MIDORIYA

12:36.673 --> 12:38.383
The evacuation system's down!

12:38.466 --> 12:40.718
There's something jamming the signal!

12:40.802 --> 12:42.553
Gunga's requesting backup!

12:43.096 --> 12:45.598
This reminds me of something that
happened when I was a shut-in...

12:45.974 --> 12:49.686
I visited the Feel Good Inc.
server for practice one day

12:49.769 --> 12:53.189
and replaced all the ads with Optic☆Kitty!

12:53.564 --> 12:57.402
Overly long functions and variables
with excessively wide scopes--

12:58.069 --> 13:02.198
Your coding habits haven't
changed at all since then!

13:03.032 --> 13:05.868
Trypophobia!

13:05.952 --> 13:08.746
You!

13:08.997 --> 13:11.332
Do you know how much money
we lost from that--?!

13:11.416 --> 13:13.001
Sorry about that!

13:20.049 --> 13:21.718
Stop it!

13:21.801 --> 13:24.053
Don't make them do the "THE Pump" dance!

13:24.429 --> 13:25.388
This is bad.

13:25.471 --> 13:28.766
Our systems are getting taken
over one after another. But--

13:29.559 --> 13:31.936
U.A. and its evacuation system--

13:32.395 --> 13:34.772
The two most abominable ones--

13:34.856 --> 13:36.816
I won't let you have those!

13:40.278 --> 13:42.071
Even if you've pinpointed where I am,

13:42.155 --> 13:44.407
I just have to run away!

13:44.490 --> 13:47.493
The flames of the revolution will never die!

13:48.453 --> 13:49.620
Tsukauchi, sir!

13:50.580 --> 13:52.999
U.A.'s altitude is dropping even more!

13:53.332 --> 13:55.626
It's heading toward land! It won't stop!

13:56.044 --> 13:58.546
Aiba, you need to do something fast!

13:58.629 --> 14:02.341
That last impact destroyed the whole system!

14:02.425 --> 14:05.636
I'm trying to reactivate the levitation
with the remaining parts right now

14:05.720 --> 14:07.930
by writing a new program!

14:08.056 --> 14:10.349
I'm not gonna make it!

14:10.892 --> 14:13.728
Were we wrong after all...

14:13.811 --> 14:16.064
to leave the all-important
final line of defense...

14:16.147 --> 14:18.900
to a villain serving time?!

14:20.902 --> 14:22.445
A crime is a crime.

14:23.196 --> 14:24.906
The past won't go away.

14:26.365 --> 14:27.408
But...

14:29.035 --> 14:31.412
There's something there.

14:42.715 --> 14:46.094
I'm your villain!

14:46.928 --> 14:49.222
You don't have to understand.

14:49.931 --> 14:54.393
It's because you don't understand
that we have heroes and villains.

14:57.605 --> 14:59.941
It's no good! I'm not getting any signal!

15:00.024 --> 15:02.235
Try it again! It's not working!

15:02.318 --> 15:03.694
We can't control it!

15:04.028 --> 15:05.196
WHAT? WHAT?
- Prepare for impact!

15:05.279 --> 15:06.531
HUH?!
- Get ready to fight!

15:06.614 --> 15:08.157
AHHH!
- What's going on?!

15:09.075 --> 15:11.077
What, what, what, what?!

15:16.582 --> 15:18.626
Twice?!

15:18.960 --> 15:20.419
MONOMAAAAA!
- Monoma!

15:20.503 --> 15:21.629
MONOMAAAAA!
- Mr. Aizawa!

15:23.506 --> 15:25.925
What are we supposed to do now?!

15:27.135 --> 15:29.470
Ethan! Use the lasers on the villains!

15:29.554 --> 15:30.805
And on our allies?

15:30.888 --> 15:32.348
Damn it!

15:32.682 --> 15:35.726
If they invade from inside, we can't--

15:38.020 --> 15:38.938
Wait...

15:47.196 --> 15:48.531
What's that?!

15:57.790 --> 16:01.711
Your location's already
been shared, Mr. Skeptic!

16:02.753 --> 16:06.215
We were the closest, so we came to get you!

16:09.468 --> 16:11.387
Jeez...

16:12.180 --> 16:14.640
What a twist of fate...

16:15.474 --> 16:20.062
That we would come to entrust
our futures to them...

16:20.771 --> 16:22.273
It's up to you now, Tobita.

16:22.690 --> 16:29.280
Do your best, Gentle...!

16:29.572 --> 16:30.698
Of course.

16:32.491 --> 16:35.119
If it's to repay him...

16:36.704 --> 16:39.957
ABOUT ONE MONTH EARLIER,
AFTER THE ATTACK ON TARTARUS

16:42.168 --> 16:46.672
MIKUZU PRISON

16:46.964 --> 16:48.883
The outside wall's down!

16:52.303 --> 16:54.305
Everyone, retreat!

17:01.145 --> 17:03.731
With this, you're all free now, too!

17:06.484 --> 17:08.527
You can do whatever you want!

17:11.864 --> 17:15.576
Now go, and do as you will!

17:16.577 --> 17:18.120
Free?

17:18.204 --> 17:19.705
Seriously...?

17:20.957 --> 17:22.833
This isn't a dream?

17:23.376 --> 17:27.088
I'm gonna get that guy that snitched on me!

17:27.171 --> 17:30.383
There was someone I missed
killing back then.

17:31.634 --> 17:33.886
What's this world coming to?

17:34.262 --> 17:35.846
Girls! Girls!

17:35.930 --> 17:37.139
Let's go crazy!

17:38.516 --> 17:40.351
What the hell's wrong with you?!

17:40.893 --> 17:44.480
W-Wait, you guys.

17:45.523 --> 17:48.568
Guys who tell you there
are no do-overs in life

17:49.068 --> 17:51.279
are either those who don't want to,

17:51.362 --> 17:54.323
or those who're impatient
and want results fast.

17:55.741 --> 17:58.202
I made a mistake in the path I took.

17:58.995 --> 18:01.664
And I didn't have the courage to stop.

18:03.207 --> 18:07.128
Are you guys really okay with this?

18:07.211 --> 18:08.212
Huh?

18:08.546 --> 18:10.881
Of course we are!

18:10.965 --> 18:14.969
Moron!

18:15.803 --> 18:17.263
I want...

18:17.847 --> 18:21.976
...to become someone who can
show them a bright future!

18:36.115 --> 18:38.492
Seven prisons were attacked,

18:39.160 --> 18:43.247
but this is the only one that
didn't have any Jailbreakers.

18:45.416 --> 18:46.751
Tobita.

18:48.711 --> 18:50.379
What do you want?

18:54.050 --> 18:55.926
I want to see La Brava.

18:57.803 --> 18:59.055
And...

19:07.772 --> 19:11.734
I thought I'd be happy if
I could just be with you.

19:13.069 --> 19:15.488
I'm stubborn, you know.

19:16.447 --> 19:17.490
I mean...

19:19.575 --> 19:22.453
If you're happy,

19:23.537 --> 19:25.998
then I'm even more happy!

19:28.209 --> 19:30.461
Absence makes...

19:43.641 --> 19:47.728
- the heart grow fonder!
- Gently Superlover!

19:59.907 --> 20:00.950
Young man,

20:03.285 --> 20:04.745
are you still fighting...

20:05.830 --> 20:10.292
for the sake of someone's smile?

20:11.710 --> 20:15.923
Back then, I wanted to help
someone who had fallen.

20:17.299 --> 20:22.763
There was no lie in how I felt!

20:31.897 --> 20:33.274
Are we safe?

20:33.357 --> 20:34.316
What?

20:35.901 --> 20:38.487
The air turned into something
like a trampoline...

20:39.321 --> 20:42.491
The air turned... into a trampoline...

20:49.790 --> 20:51.000
I just...

20:52.585 --> 20:54.628
...wanted to help!

20:56.338 --> 20:57.673
Gentle!

20:58.215 --> 21:00.634
Gentle Criminal!

21:01.260 --> 21:03.012
Kid! This is bad!

21:03.721 --> 21:05.639
He's started moving!

21:05.723 --> 21:07.224
The balance is--

21:09.310 --> 21:11.103
Even if we've stopped falling,

21:11.187 --> 21:14.732
if that hand touches the ground...!

21:28.496 --> 21:30.122
No matter how far they go,

21:31.081 --> 21:33.334
villains are still human.

21:34.460 --> 21:38.589
We need to look at that part of them.

21:39.924 --> 21:42.343
To borrow the words of a friend,

21:47.348 --> 21:50.059
we need to look deep in their hearts--

21:51.519 --> 21:53.521
For their origins.

23:25.946 --> 23:26.906
PREVIEW

23:26.989 --> 23:27.948
PREVIEW
- Here's the preview.

23:28.908 --> 23:31.493
The bullet shot by Lady Nagant

23:31.577 --> 23:33.120
pierces Shigaraki.

23:33.829 --> 23:35.289
And it's not just her.

23:35.372 --> 23:39.877
The pro heroes, everyone in U.A.'s
hero course and business course,

23:40.419 --> 23:45.174
and even THEY join the fight again!

23:45.841 --> 23:47.343
Next time, "Hopes."

23:47.885 --> 23:52.640
All their wishes become a chain
of hope that starts to spread.

23:52.723 --> 23:54.099
NEXT TIME
- Go beyond!

23:54.183 --> 23:55.476
NEXT TIME
- Plus Ultra!
